data: {"id": "b670a386bb5a4e26-final", "run_id": "b670a386bb5a4e26", "seq": 1194, "ts_ms": 1788439277487, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | {'container': 'app', 'reason': 'Error'} |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container app exit_code: 2; Reason: Error | 确认容器异常退出状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Warning BackOff: Back-off restarting failed container app (x201 over 45m) | 确认 CrashLoopBackOff 症状与频率 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | CPU Request: 20m, Limit: 200m; Memory Request: 24Mi, Limit: 96Mi | 排除资源硬性限制（Limit）导致的 OOMKilled |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason = Error; restart_count = 13 | 确认退出原因为 Error 且非资源耗尽 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | kube_pod_status_phase = 1 (Running); kube_pod_status_phase (Failed) = 0 | 当前 Pod 处于 Running 状态但容器处于重启循环中 |\n| 6 | Logging | elasticsearch | Pattern: 'runtime process exiting' at path /work, HTTP status 500; Trace IDs: 491a5553... etc. | 锁定故障触发点为 /work 接口处理时的应用层崩溃 |\n| 7 | Logging | elasticsearch | Pattern: 'request completed' at path /work, HTTP status 200; 内存 allocated_mib 始终为 0 | 证明应用具备服务请求的能力，故障非内存超限导致 |\n| 8 | Tracing | deepflow | L7 Flow: GET /work response_code 500; duration_us 5384-6746 | 证实 HTTP 请求在应用处理阶段即被拒绝并返回 500 |\n| 9 | Tracing | tempo | Span GET /work trace_id 97a75c07... attributes: http.response.status_code 200 | 提供正常成功请求的耗时基线，辅助判断故障为瞬间崩溃 |\n\n证据链显示 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，K8s 与 Metric 确认退出原因为 Error (Exit Code 2)。Logging 与 Tracing 交叉印证表明，应用在处理 `/work` 接口时直接返回 HTTP 500 并随即发生 \"runtime process exiting\"，同时排除了资源超限导致的 OOM（日志内存占用为 0）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码 /work 逻辑未捕获的异常 → HTTP 500 错误响应 → 进程记录 'runtime process exiting' (Exit Code 2) → K8s 重启失败并进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**证据不足 (inconclusive)**。\n当前事实已确凿证明故障现象：应用在 `/work` 接口处理时发生内部错误返回 HTTP 500，随后以 Exit Code 2 强制终止，引发容器 CrashLoopBackOff。\n\n然而，导致该现象的**根本原因（Root Cause）无法确认**。现有证据中缺失应用层详细的堆栈跟踪（Stack Trace）与底层异常信息，日志仅记录了高层退出事件，无法判断具体是代码 Bug、参数校验失败还是内部依赖不可用所致。此外，正式 RCA 的发布因配置限制（RCA fact binding and publication validation disabled）被禁用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 62.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 62.8s (Evidence 53.0s, RCA 9.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.175, "metrics": {"run_id": "b670a386bb5a4e26", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.17940855026245, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "56%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 95179.40855026245, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 67886.76524162292, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 79003.42273712158, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 26807.976961135864}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 20977.173566818237, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 62811.068534851074, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11366.679191589355, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

